==Norwegian Nynorsk==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|nn|/doː/}} {{nn-pronu-note}}
* In the third sense of the adverb, it should always be pronounced unstressed.

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|nn|non|þá}}, from {{inh|nn|gem-pro|*þan||then}}. Its use as a conjunction can be seen as taken from the {{der|nn|non|-}} combination {{m|non|þá er}} ({{m|non|er}} being the actual conjunction).

====Alternative forms====
* {{alt|nn|da}}
* {{alt|nn|daa||obsolete spelling}}

====Conjunction====
{{head|nn|conjunction}}

# [[when]] (at a time in the past)
#: {{ux|nn|'''Då''' morgonen kom, hadde vêret vorte betre.|'''When''' the morning came, the weather had gotten better.}}
# [[since]], [[as]] {{q|used to denote a reason}}
#: {{syn|nn|ettersom}}

====Adverb====
{{head|nn|adverb}}

# [[then]] {{gloss|at that time}}
#: {{ux|nn|Fyrst '''då''' kan me gjera noko med det.|We can't do anything about it until '''then'''.}}
# [[then]] (in that case)
#: {{usex|nn|'''Då''' er eg redd det er lite me kan gjera.|'''Then''' I am afraid there is little we can do.}}
# {{lb|nn|filler|intesifier}} [[though]], [[yet]], [[then]]
#: {{syn|nn|altso|no}}
#: {{ux|nn|Det var '''då''' litt feil å gjera det, ikkje sant?|It was a little bit wrong to do it '''then''', wasn’t it?}}
#: {{ux|nn|Kom no med oss '''då'''!|Come with us!}}
#: {{ux|nn|Du kunne ikkje finne dei i huset, men eg såg inn i skuret, so var dei der '''då'''|You could not find them in the house, but I looked into the shed, and they were there '''apparently'''}}

=====Derived terms=====
* {{l|nn|dåtid}}
* {{l|nn|no og då}}

===Etymology 2===
{{wikipedia|lang=nn|Dåslekta}}
[[File:Galeopsis tetrahit - kare kõrvik Keilas.jpg|thumb|[[kvassdå|kvass'''då''']], the common hemp-nettle]]
From {{der|nn|non|ákrdái}}, whence also {{cog|sv|dån}}. Related to {{m|nn|døy||to die}}.

====Alternative forms====
* {{alt|nn|dæ|g=m,f|dæe|g2=m}}

====Noun====
{{nn-noun-m1}}

# {{senseid|nn|hemp-nettle}} a [[hemp-nettle]]

=====Derived terms=====
* {{l|nn|dundå}}
* {{l|nn|guldå}}
* {{l|nn|kvassdå}}
* {{l|nn|smaldå}}
* {{l|nn|vrangdå}}

===References===
* {{R:The Nynorsk Dictionary}}

==Swedish==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|sv|da|id=då||adverb; eye dialect}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|sv|gmq-osw|þa|þā}}, from {{inh|sv|non|þá}}, from {{inh|sv|gem-pro|*þan||then}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|sv|/doː/|[doː]}}
* {{audio|sv|Sv-då.ogg}}
* {{rhymes|sv|oː|s=1}}

===Adverb===
{{sv-adv|-}}

# [[then]]; at that time
# [[then]]; in that case
# [[what about]], [[how about]]
#: {{ux|sv|Den där, '''då'''?|'''What about''' that one?}}

===Conjunction===
{{head|sv|conjunction}}

# [[when]]; at the same point in time as
#: {{ux|sv|Vi sov '''då''' branden började.|We were sleeping '''when''' the fire started.}}
# {{lb|sv|dated}} [[since]], [[as]]; by background of the case being that
#: {{ux|sv|'''Då''' inget tvivel tycks råda om hans skuld, beslutar jag härmed...|'''Since''' there seems to be no doubts about his guilt, I hereby decide...}}

====Usage notes====
* In the first use, it is far more common to use {{m|sv|när}} than {{m|sv|då}}, which is very rare in spoken language.
* In the second use, it is far more common to use {{m|sv|eftersom}}; {{m|sv|då}} may be perceived as archaic.

====Derived terms====
* {{l|sv|hej då}}

